an class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是邻接矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是总边数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在同社区时为 1。识别社群后，可把&quot;所在社群的欺诈标签密度&quot;作为特征——若某账户的邻居社群中已知欺诈节点占比高，即使账户本身历史清白，风险也显著上升。<strong>中心性</strong>则衡量节点在团伙中的角色：度中心性找连接最多的枢纽，介数中心性找资金/信息中转的桥梁，PageRank 找被众多可疑节点共同引用的节点。</p>\n<p><strong>传播类特征</strong>（label propagation）把已确认的欺诈标签沿边扩散并距离衰减。设节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 在距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 内的已知欺诈邻居数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_k(v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则传播分为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(v) = \\sum_{k=1}^{K} w_k \\, f_k(v), \\qquad w_k = \\lambda^{k}, \\ 0&lt;\\lambda&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制衰减速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是传播半径。这类特征对&quot;新加入团伙的账户&quot;最有效——它本身没有历史，但紧邻已被确认的欺诈节点。图神经网络（GraphSAGE，Hamilton 等，2017）把节点属性与邻居结构编码为嵌入，但生产上要权衡<strong>推理延迟</strong>与<strong>分布漂移</strong>，常见做法是离线算好嵌入、在线只做向量检索。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Raw[原始观测&lt;br/&gt;账户/设备/卡/地址/IP] --&gt; Norm[归一化&lt;br/&gt;剥离tag/E.164/地址展开]&#10;  Norm --&gt; Block[分块&lt;br/&gt;PC/PQ 权衡]&#10;  Block --&gt; Match[匹配判定&lt;br/&gt;Fellegi-Sunter 似然比]&#10;  Match --&gt; Graph[(实体图谱&lt;br/&gt;带属性多重图)]&#10;  Graph --&gt; Local[局部特征&lt;br/&gt;多窗口度数/邻域标签密度]&#10;  Graph --&gt; Comm[社群特征&lt;br/&gt;Louvain/标签传播]&#10;  Graph --&gt; Prop[传播特征&lt;br/&gt;衰减标签扩散]&#10;  Local --&gt; Store[在线特征存储]&#10;  Comm --&gt; Store&#10;  Prop --&gt; Store&#10;  Store --&gt; Decide[授权决策点&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级读取]&#10;  Decide -.结果标签.-&gt; Graph\">graph TD\n  Raw[原始观测&lt;br/&gt;账户/设备/卡/地址/IP] --&gt; Norm[归一化&lt;br/&gt;剥离tag/E.164/地址展开]\n  Norm --&gt; Block[分块&lt;br/&gt;PC/PQ 权衡]\n  Block --&gt; Match[匹配判定&lt;br/&gt;Fellegi-Sunter 似然比]\n  Match --&gt; Graph[(实体图谱&lt;br/&gt;带属性多重图)]\n  Graph --&gt; Local[局部特征&lt;br/&gt;多窗口度数/邻域标签密度]\n  Graph --&gt; Comm[社群特征&lt;br/&gt;Louvain/标签传播]\n  Graph --&gt; Prop[传播特征&lt;br/&gt;衰减标签扩散]\n  Local --&gt; Store[在线特征存储]\n  Comm --&gt; Store\n  Prop --&gt; Store\n  Store --&gt; Decide[授权决策点&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级读取]\n  Decide -.结果标签.-&gt; Graph</pre><h2 id=\"在线特征存储-一致性-点查与实时聚合\">在线特征存储：一致性、点查与实时聚合</h2><p>算出特征只是前半程，后半程是在<strong>授权决策的几十毫秒内</strong>送达且数值正确。特征存储（feature store）有两派：<strong>双存储</strong>架构（Feast、Tecton、AWS SageMaker Feature Store 一类）用离线存储做训练与回填、在线存储（Redis、DynamoDB、Cassandra）做低延迟点查，同一份特征定义物化到两侧；<strong>流式优先</strong>架构（基于 Flink/ksqlDB 的实时聚合）在特征流过时即计算写入在线存储。核心契约是<strong>训练-服务一致性</strong>（training-serving consistency）：离线算训练特征与在线算推理特征必须用同一套变换逻辑与同一时间语义，否则线下 AUC 再好线上也会系统性打折。最经典的破坏者是<strong>时间旅行</strong>——训练样本只能用该笔交易<strong>发生时点之前</strong>已知的信息；若用了&quot;最终账户 30 天交易数&quot;这类含未来信息的聚合，模型会学到线上不存在的信号而崩塌。纪律是<strong>基于时间点的正确连接</strong>（point-in-time correct join，as-of join）：特征值取样本时间戳之前最近一次物化的版本。业界把<strong>特征新鲜度</strong>与<strong>标签新鲜度</strong>分开：特征可秒级更新，标签往往要等人工评审数天；训练样本只能取<strong>标签成熟之后</strong>的数据，否则会把&quot;尚未出结论&quot;误当&quot;正常&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>离线存储</th>\n<th>在线存储</th>\n<th>一致性要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>秒—分钟（批/仓）</td>\n<td>亚毫秒—几毫秒点查</td>\n<td>逻辑与窗口对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据</td>\n<td>历史全量、可回填</td>\n<td>每实体最新值 + TTL</td>\n<td>时间戳语义一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>训练、回填、审计</td>\n<td>授权决策、实时评分</td>\n<td>训练-服务一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新</td>\n<td>按调度</td>\n<td>事件驱动流式</td>\n<td>新鲜度监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实时聚合</strong>最容易出错。&quot;近 1 小时每设备下单数&quot;用 Redis <code>INCR</code> + 过期键实现简单但精度受 TTL 粒度限制，用有序集合按时间戳存事件精度高但内存开销大；更稳的是把窗口聚合交给流处理（Flink 滑动窗口）写中间结果、在线只做点查。<strong>冷启动</strong>是另一难点：新实体读不到历史时必须返回明确默认值（如 0 或&quot;无历史&quot;标志）而非空值，且要与训练时的填充一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟预算-隐私与运维监控\">延迟预算、隐私与运维监控</h2><p>把图谱与特征存储放进授权链路，延迟预算是硬约束。跨境电商常见目标是<strong>风控总预算控制在 100 毫秒以内</strong>：在线特征点查 10–30 毫秒、图查询 5–20 毫秒、模型推理 20–50 毫秒，其余留给网络与编排。这意味着图查询<strong>不能做多跳遍历</strong>，只能查预计算的邻域统计量；社群发现这类全局算法必须在离线跑、在线读结果。</p>\n<p>失败模式必须有降级链：特征存储超时、图服务不可用、模型加载失败时，决策应逐级降级——缺图特征时回退到只用身份/设备特征评分，缺全部在线特征时降级到规则兜底（金额、地域、黑名单），并<strong>标记本次决策为降级模式</strong>以便事后归因。阈值应按业务成本矩阵（见 <a href=\"../fraud-taxonomy-decision-economics/decision-economics-cost-matrix-expected-loss\">决策经济学：成本矩阵与期望损失</a>）设定。隐私与合规贯穿图谱与特征存储：欧盟 <strong>ePrivacy 指令</strong>（2002/58/EC 第 5(3) 条）要求访问终端存储前取得同意，<strong>GDPR</strong> 第 5(1)(c) 条要求数据最小化，<strong>CCPA/CPRA</strong>（2023-01-01 生效）赋予删除与退出权，中国 <strong>PIPL</strong> 对个人信息跨境提供另有要求；图谱把设备、地址、联系方式固化为长期关系，删除权下<strong>不仅要删节点还要删边并重算受影响的聚合特征</strong>。若图谱与 PAN 关联存储，则落进 <strong>PCI DSS v4.0.1</strong>（PCI SSC，2024）的持卡人数据环境范围。工程原则是加盐 HMAC 替代裸哈希、按商户或区域分域阻断裂关联、派生特征设最短留存期。</p>\n<p>运维监控盯四类指标：<strong>特征新鲜度</strong>、<strong>训练-服务一致性</strong>（离线重算与在线实际值的抽样比对，差异持续超阈值即告警）、<strong>特征漂移</strong>、<strong>图指标</strong>（节点/边增长率、实体解析合并/拆分率、社群规模突刺）。反馈回路还要防偏差：被规则拦下的交易不产生真实标签，模型只在放行样本上学习，长期低估被拦群体欺诈率；缓解靠小比例随机放行做对照组、把人工评审结论（见 <a href=\"../review-ops-guarantee-feedback-loop/\">评审运营与保障反馈回路</a>）作为高质量标签回流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实体图谱是<strong>带属性的多重图</strong>，边要携带交互类型、时间戳与结果标签，纯拓扑会被浏览类噪声稀释；方向语义（谁付款、谁收款、谁是中转）决定可问的问题。</li>\n<li>实体解析决定图上限：归一化 → 分块（配对完备性与配对质量权衡）→ 似然比匹配（Fellegi-Sunter）；过度合并比漏合并危险，合并需可回滚。</li>\n<li>图特征分四类：多窗口邻域度数、社群结构（Louvain 模块度 / 标签传播）、中心性（度/介数/PageRank）、衰减标签传播；GNN 嵌入需权衡延迟与漂移。</li>\n<li>在线特征存储的硬契约是<strong>训练-服务一致性</strong>与<strong>基于时间点的正确连接</strong>以防时间旅行；实时聚合要统一窗口语义，冷启动返回与训练一致的默认值。</li>\n<li>延迟预算下图查询只做预计算邻域统计、不做多跳遍历；存储/图/模型均需逐级降级并标记降级模式。合规把图谱与特征存储纳入数据最小化、删除权与跨境传输约束，删除须连带删边与重算派生特征。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实体关联图谱分析与在线特征存储","id":"实体关联图谱分析与在线特征存储"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实体解析：解开别名、大小写与地址漂移","id":"实体解析-解开别名-大小写与地址漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"图特征：度数、社群与中心性","id":"图特征-度数-社群与中心性"},{"level":2,"text":"在线特征存储：一致性、点查与实时聚合","id":"在线特征存储-一致性-点查与实时聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟预算、隐私与运维监控","id":"延迟预算-隐私与运维监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"行为生物特征与速度/时序特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/signals-features-identity-device-graph/behavioral-velocity-temporal-features"},"next":{"title":"规则引擎 DSL 与决策流编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/decision-engine-rules-model-fusion/rule-engine-dsl-decision-flow-orchestration"}}